---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Immobilien Müller — Ihr Makler in der Region</title>
  <link rel="preload" as="font" href="/fonts/Sora-latin.woff2" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preload" as="font" href="/fonts/Outfit-latin.woff2" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
  <style>
    @font-face { font-family: 'Sora'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400 800; font-display: swap; src: url('/fonts/Sora-latin.woff2') format('woff2'); }
    @font-face { font-family: 'Outfit'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300 600; font-display: swap; src: url('/fonts/Outfit-latin.woff2') format('woff2'); }
  </style>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { background: #08101E; color: #E2E8F0; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; }
    .nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 20px 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2); }
    .logo { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #E2E8F0; }
    .logo span { color: #3B82F6; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { color: #94A3B8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #E2E8F0; }
    .btn { background: #3B82F6; color: #fff; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .hero { padding: 100px 48px 80px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; align-items: center; }
    .hero-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3); border-radius: 100px; padding: 6px 16px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .hero h1 { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .hero h1 span { color: #3B82F6; }
    .hero p { color: #94A3B8; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn-outline { border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.4); color: #3B82F6; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .search-box { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; }
    .search-title { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748B; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .search-field { width: 100%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: none; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; }
    .search-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .search-submit { width: 100%; background: #3B82F6; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 4px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; }
    .properties { padding: 80px 48px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .properties h2 { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .properties-subtitle { color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .property-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .property-card { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.15); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .property-img { height: 180px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59,130,246,0.2) 0%, rgba(59,130,246,0.05) 100%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .property-img svg { opacity: 0.3; }
    .property-tag { position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 12px; background: #3B82F6; color: #fff; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .property-img-wrap { position: relative; }
    .property-body { padding: 20px; }
    .property-price { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .property-title { font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .property-meta { display: flex; gap: 16px; color: #64748B; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    .meta-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
    .property-cta { display: block; margin-top: 16px; text-align: center; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2); color: #3B82F6; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.15); padding: 32px 48px; text-align: center; color: #64748B; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    footer a { color: #3B82F6; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="logo">Immobilien <span>Müller</span></div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#">Kaufen</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Mieten</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Verkaufen</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Über uns</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="#" class="btn">Kostenlose Bewertung</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span style="width:8px;height:8px;background:#10B981;border-radius:50%;"></span>
        Ihr regionaler Immobilienmakler
      </div>
      <h1>Ihr Traumhaus.<br><span>Wir finden es.</span></h1>
      <p>Über 20 Jahre Erfahrung in der Region. Wir begleiten Sie beim Kauf, Verkauf und der Vermietung Ihrer Immobilie — persönlich, kompetent, erfolgreich.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#" class="btn">Immobilien suchen</a>
        <a href="#" class="btn-outline">Kostenlose Bewertung</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="search-box">
      <div class="search-title">Immobilie finden</div>
      <select class="search-field" style="cursor:pointer;appearance:none;">
        <option>Kaufen</option><option>Mieten</option>
      </select>
      <input class="search-field" type="text" placeholder="Ort, PLZ oder Stadtbezirk" />
      <div class="search-row">
        <select class="search-field" style="cursor:pointer;"><option>Alle Immobilientypen</option><option>Haus</option><option>Wohnung</option></select>
        <select class="search-field" style="cursor:pointer;"><option>Alle Preise</option><option>bis 200.000 €</option><option>bis 400.000 €</option></select>
      </div>
      <button class="search-submit">Jetzt suchen →</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="properties">
    <h2>Aktuelle Objekte</h2>
    <p class="properties-subtitle">Ausgewählte Immobilien in Ihrer Region</p>
    <div class="property-grid">
      <div class="property-card">
        <div class="property-img-wrap">
          <div class="property-img"><svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3B82F6" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg></div>
          <div class="property-tag">KAUF</div>
        </div>
        <div class="property-body">
          <div class="property-price">485.000 €</div>
          <div class="property-title">Einfamilienhaus mit Garten</div>
          <div class="property-meta">
            <span class="meta-item">🏠 142 m²</span>
            <span class="meta-item">🛏 4 Zi.</span>
            <span class="meta-item">📍 Aachen</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#" class="property-cta">Details ansehen →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="property-card">
        <div class="property-img-wrap">
          <div class="property-img"><svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3B82F6" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="18" rx="2"/><line x1="2" y1="9" x2="22" y2="9"/><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="9"/></svg></div>
          <div class="property-tag">KAUF</div>
        </div>
        <div class="property-body">
          <div class="property-price">295.000 €</div>
          <div class="property-title">Moderne 3-Zimmer-Wohnung</div>
          <div class="property-meta">
            <span class="meta-item">🏠 89 m²</span>
            <span class="meta-item">🛏 3 Zi.</span>
            <span class="meta-item">📍 Köln</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#" class="property-cta">Details ansehen →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="property-card">
        <div class="property-img-wrap">
          <div class="property-img"><svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3B82F6" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><line x1="9" y1="22" x2="9" y2="12"/><line x1="15" y1="22" x2="15" y2="12"/><line x1="9" y1="12" x2="15" y2="12"/></svg></div>
          <div class="property-tag">MIETE</div>
        </div>
        <div class="property-body">
          <div class="property-price">1.450 € / Mo.</div>
          <div class="property-title">Doppelhaushälfte mit Terrasse</div>
          <div class="property-meta">
            <span class="meta-item">🏠 118 m²</span>
            <span class="meta-item">🛏 4 Zi.</span>
            <span class="meta-item">📍 Düren</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#" class="property-cta">Details ansehen →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>© 2024 Immobilien Müller · Website von <a href="https://elevo.solutions">ELEVO Webagentur Aachen</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
